* view customer/shipping information

Do NOT build an elaborate admin UI yet unless one already exists. Focus on the API/data layer.

SEED DATA:

Use the existing mock EVYS products/categories as DEVELOPMENT seed data only.

Clearly label the seed system/data as mock/demo data.

The application must be designed so the real catalogue can later be imported from CSV/Excel without changing the database architecture.

